{"id":2733,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>4月15日，中北大学“国安有我 反诈同行”国家安全观宣讲大赛圆满落幕。我院李佳玥同学紧扣赛事主题，以深刻的理论解读、真挚的情感表达和出色的宣讲功底，在参赛选手中表现亮眼，成功斩获大赛一等奖。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=WM7rHfMNMVL4MfMgllboRU4MNCYL4vLYLzvaL8r2nzC8nR90gihFp2hmCIa0LYh7MShknkysMzv4UmNYL8LPM8QfUl-4LN-8UNnkU8LaLNWFLm9snzGbMRMFUNV7LSb/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CsoRlJqdMnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6785&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/3D5BD7573B923C17FAAB32B4BDBCC02B/287E0943/BAD1\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 495px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=WM7rHfMNMVL4MfMgllboRU4MNCYL4vLYLzvaL8r2nzC8nR90gihFp2hmCIa0LYh7MShknkysMzv4UmNYL8LPM8QfUl-4LN-8UNnkU8LaLNWFLm9snzGbMRMFUNV7LSb/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CsoRlJqdMnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6785&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>此次获奖充分展现了我院学子过硬的综合素养与良好精神风貌，也体现了我院在国家安全观主题宣讲教育与筑牢青年思想安全防线的育人实效。未来学院将持续强化理论宣讲，推动总体国家安全观入脑入心，引导青年学子以实际行动守护国家安全。</p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://mkszyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=WM7rHfMNMVL4MfMgllboRU4MNCYL4vLYLzvaL8r2nzC8nR90gihFp2hmCIa0LYh7MShknkysMzv4UmNYL8LPM8QfUl-4LN-8UNnkU8LaLNWFLm9snzGbMRMFUNV7LSb/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CsoRlJqdMnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6785&e=.jpeg"}